 * Description:
 *   For the kernel build (CONFIG_BUILD_PROTECTED=y) with both kernel- and
 *   user-space heaps (CONFIG_MM_KERNEL_HEAP=y), this function allocates
 *   (and protects) the kernel-space heap.
